@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam dpi 300

|Customer|
start
:Browse virtual restaurant brands within selected Hub;
:Select dishes and customize options / special instructions;
:Add items to unified cart;

|SaigonBite System|
:Verify all cart items originate from the same Hub location;
if (Multi-hub cross-cart detected?) then (Yes)
  :Display warning and prompt customer to clear cart or switch Hub;
  |Customer|
  stop
else (No - Single Hub valid)
endif

|Customer|
:Proceed to checkout screen;
:Specify delivery drop-off address;

|SaigonBite System|
:Calculate delivery distance from Hub (max 7.0 km);
:Compute tiered delivery fee (15,000 VND / 2km + 5,000 VND/km);

|Customer|
if (Customer enters promotional voucher code?) then (Yes)
  :Input voucher code;
  |SaigonBite System|
  :Validate voucher validity dates, minimum spend & remaining quota;
  :Apply discount percentage / quiet-kitchen incentive;
  :Recalculate order final total;
else (No)
endif

|Customer|
:Select preferred payment method (Online Card / COD VND);
:Click 'Place Order';

|SaigonBite System|
if (Payment method is Online Card/E-Wallet?) then (Online)
  :Initiate payment gateway transaction authorization;
  :Verify transaction authorization success;
  :Record Payment record with status 'Authorized';
else (COD)
  :Record Payment record with status 'PendingCOD';
endif

:Create persistent Order and OrderLine records;
:Set Order status to 'Placed';
:Dispatch order alert notification to Hub kitchen display;
:Send order confirmation receipt to Customer;

|Customer|
:View order tracking screen with 2-minute kitchen SLA countdown;
stop

@enduml